{"id":"wb-6-825","name":"齐云山石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"齐云山石刻","text":"齐云山石刻位于中国安徽省休宁县齐云山镇齐云山上，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n齐云山是道教名山，有三十六奇峰、七十三怪岩、二十四幽涧，自唐代即香火旺盛、游客众多。历代题刻甚多，现存摩崖石刻305处，碑刻232块，其中年代最早的刻于北宋大观年间，大多为明清两朝所刻。规模最大的石刻为玉虚宫紫霄崖下《紫霄玄帝碑铭》，高7.6米，宽1.4米，为明代唐寅所题。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BD%90%E4%BA%91%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB","revisionId":84929126,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84929126","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/196c0d525c8be2a182007077.jpg","title":"Xiuning_Qiyun_Shan_2015.06.28_13-53-05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiuning_Qiyun_Shan_2015.06.28_13-53-05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/Xiuning_Qiyun_Shan_2015.06.28_13-53-05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"齐云山石刻","width":320,"height":213}}